gure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-18.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-18.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-17.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-19.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/fotogrammetrie-obr-19.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure> </div> ",
